WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:03.837
Right now, I'm reworking my business plan

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:06.006
for my meeting with the bank tomorrow.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.926
Right now, I'm updating our family budget.

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:12.762
[cow mooing]
Yeah, I hear ya.

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:14.389
Right now, I’m checking

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:17.308
ten different online marketplaces for used cars.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:19.686
I'm planning

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.187
my semester abroad.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:24.274
I'm comparing 15 different napkin suppliers.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.233
I'm doing a daily sweep

00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:26.776
for new apartment listings

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:28.445
that are cool with multiple cats!

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.988
[cats meowing]

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.322
I'm also doing that.

00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:32.657
Right now,

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:35.118
I'm reading all 3 bajillion emails

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:36.327
from my kids’ school.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:37.454
I'm doing a daily check

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:39.164
for engineering internships.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.833
I’m keeping an eye on Doja Cat tickets.

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:43.543
I'm researching vacations.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:45.503
I’m ironing my tie...

00:00:45.503 --> 00:00:47.464
but I'm also revising my presentation.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.175
I did it.

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:52.218
I did it.

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.013
I did it!

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:56.473
[”The Rain (Supa Dupa Fly)” by Missy Elliott plays]
